Subject: Why scaling predictor variables, and how to back-transform model-averaged estimates?
Message-ID: <DHe_gN2Ks1E.gSNnRBdwAAAJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/unmarked/c/DHe_gN2Ks1E/m/gSNnRBdwAAAJ>
