t4      3    99.59   0.00   0.435      0.44
t1      2   101.00   1.40   0.216      0.65
t2      3   102.60   3.00   0.097      0.75
t3      3   102.80   3.21   0.087      0.84
t6      3   102.89   3.30   0.084      0.92
t5      3   102.97   3.37   0.081      1.00

- Sp1 shrinking model-averaging beta estimates were:

Intercept:
Model-averaged estimate with shrinkage: 1.26
