Unconditional SE: 1.06
95% Unconditional confidence interval: -3.03, 1.13

Vegetation type:
Model-averaged estimate with shrinkage: 0.02
Unconditional SE: 0.32
95% Unconditional confidence interval: -0.61, 0.65

- Sp2 shrinking model-averaging beta estimates were:

