Unconditional SE: 0.72

95% Unconditional confidence interval: -1.58, 1.26

Paved road:

Model-averaged estimate with shrinkage: 1.21

Unconditional SE: 1.32

95% Unconditional confidence interval: -1.38, 3.8

Dist. permanent river:

Model-averaged estimate with shrinkage: 0.18

Unconditional SE: 0.45

95% Unconditional confidence interval: -0.71, 1.06

Dist. village:

Model-averaged estimate with shrinkage: 0

Unconditional SE: 0.15

95% Unconditional confidence interval: -0.29, 0.29

Elevation:

Model-averaged estimate with shrinkage: 0.08

